# Gradius III Legends: g3l.keys (Space every 2 s, UP at 100 s, DOWN at 110 s) with SNAPs
# around the UP/DOWN presses to see the screen AmiMSX shows there (POWER METER SELECT?).
14s   SPACE 5 every 100 until 200s
100s  UP 30
110s  DOWN 30
96s   SNAP 60
99.5s SNAP 60
102s  SNAP 60
106s  SNAP 60
109.5s SNAP 60
112s  SNAP 60
